Following up:

The back-converted file can indeed be used to process data using
AffyTiling method AnalyzeTilingCelFiles - I needed to provide the
correct option:

IgnoreBpmapCelPlatformMismatch=TRUE

I should have looked at the method implementation before posting - my
apologies for cluttering the list!

Sincerely,

Ann Loraine


