Subject: [BioC] Drosophila Genome build used for GeneChip Drosophila-2
 CDF?
In-Reply-To: <aa6956da1001121827m6408bd0dua8e0b9b45ad9757f@mail.gmail.com>
References: <aa6956da1001120934v70b8bc10q72313b51e10975b6@mail.gmail.com>
