From Joern.Toedling at curie.fr  Thu Jan 21 13:56:04 2010
From: Joern.Toedling at curie.fr (Joern Toedling)
Date: Thu, 21 Jan 2010 13:56:04 +0100
Subject: [BioC] Question about RINGO and follow up analysis
In-Reply-To: <4B583353.1090404@gmx.de>
