Hi Memon,

RemoveProbes() requires the probe name, in the format of 117_at1 or 
117_at9, not the x,y coordinates. I'm not sure there's an easy way to 
get from x,y coordinates to probe names, but some combination of 
indexProbes() and indices2xy() should work. You'll need an AffyBatch 
object of the raw data to test it, called "rawdata" in my code below.

 > x <- unlist(indexProbes(rawdata,genenames="117_at"))
 > x     # this will give you the indices of the pm probes for probe 
set 117_at along with their names

 > y <- indices2xy(x, abatch=rawdata)
 > y     # this will give you the x,y coordinates along with the 
correct probe names

HTH,
Jenny





